{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"宰相世系五","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"敬氏出自媯姓。陳厲公子完適齊，諡曰敬仲，子孫以諡為氏。敬仲之後至秦有敬丕，丕","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"生教，為河東太守，子孫因官家焉。裔孫韶，漢末為揚州刺史，生昌，封猗氏侯。昌生","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"歸。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"敬氏宰相一人。暉。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"敬氏表","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"桓氏出自姜姓。齊桓公之後，以諡為氏。又云，出自子姓，宋桓公之後向魋，亦號桓氏","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"。後漢有太子少傅桓榮，世居譙國龍亢。榮八世孫彝，晉宣城內史。五子：雲、溫、豁","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"、祕、沖。沖，荊州刺史、豐城公，生嗣、謙、修。修，晉護軍將軍、長社侯，過江居","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"丹楊。生尹，尹生崇之，崇之七世孫法嗣。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"法嗣，郇王府諮議參軍。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"思敏，少府丞。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"彥範，相中宗。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"臣範，京兆尹。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"庭昌，刑部郎中。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"桓氏宰相一人。彥範。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"祝氏出自姬姓。周武王克商，封黃帝之後於祝，後為齊所并，其封域至齊之間祝阿、祝","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"丘是也。後漢有司徒恬，孫羲生廣，廣為始平太守，子孫留家焉。生魏太中大夫仍，仍","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"生諶，晉驃騎府司馬。諶生偃，散騎常侍，以平關中兵寇，封始平縣伯。生瑜，瑜生熙","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"，熙生寶，三世襲封。二子：老、歸。老，後魏輔國將軍、中外都督。二子：猷、俟。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"祝氏宰相一人。欽明。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"祝氏表","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"紀氏出自姜姓。炎帝之後封於紀，侯爵，為齊所滅，因以國為氏。隋有司農少卿和整，","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"世居天水上邽，生士騰。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"士騰，隋翼州刺史。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"儼，雍州司倉參軍。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"先知，御史中丞。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"黃中。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"全經，戶部郎中。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"謙。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"咸。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"及，廓州刺史。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"處訥，相中宗。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"紀氏宰相一人。處訥。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"鄭氏出自姬姓。周厲王少子友封於鄭，是為桓公，其地華州鄭縣是也。生武公，與晉文","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"侯夾輔平王，東遷於洛，徙溱、洧之間，謂之新鄭，其地河南新鄭是也。十三世孫幽公","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"為韓所滅，子孫播遷陳、宋之間，以國為氏。幽公生公子魯，魯六世孫榮，號鄭君，生","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"當時，漢大司農，居滎陽開封。生韜，韜生江都守仲，仲生房，房生趙相季，季生議郎","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"奇。奇生稚，漢末自陳居河南開封，晉置滎陽郡，遂為郡人。稚生御史中丞賔，賔生興","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"，字贛，蓮勺令。興生衆，字仲師，大司農。衆生城門校尉安世，安世生騎都尉綝，綝","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_41","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"生上計掾熙，熙二子：泰、渾。渾，魏少府大匠。渾生崇，晉荊州刺史。崇生遹，遹生","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"隨，扶風太守。隨生趙侍中略，略六子：翳、豁、淵、靜、悅、楚。豁字君明，燕太子","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_43","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"少傅、濟南公，生溫。溫四子：濤、曄、簡、恬。濤居隴西。曄，後魏建威將軍、南陽","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_44","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"公，為北祖。簡為南祖。恬為中祖。曄生中書博士茂，一名小白，七子：白麟、胤伯、","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"叔夜、洞林、歸藏、連山、幼麟，因號「七房鄭氏」。大房白麟後絕，第三房叔夜後無","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"聞。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"鄭氏定著二房：一曰北祖，二曰南祖。宰相九人。北祖有珣瑜、覃、朗、餘慶、從讜、","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"延昌；南祖有絪；滎陽鄭氏有畋；滄州鄭氏有愔。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"鄭氏表","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"鍾氏出自子姓，與宗氏皆晉伯宗之後也。伯宗子州犁仕楚，食采於鍾離，因以為姓。楚","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_51","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"漢時有鍾離眛，為項羽將，有二子：長曰發，居九江，仍故姓；次曰接，居潁川長社，","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_52","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"為鍾氏。漢有西曹掾皓，字季明，二子：迪、敷。迪，郡主簿，生繇、演。繇字元常，","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_53","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"魏太傅、定陵侯。生毓、會。毓字稚叔，侍中、廷尉。生駿，駿字伯道，晉黃門侍郎。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_54","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"生廚，字叔光，公府掾。生雅，字彥冑，過江仕晉，侍中。生誕，字世長，中軍參軍。","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_55","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"生靖，字道寂，潁川太守。生源，字循本，後魏永安太守。生挺，字法秀，襄城太守、","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_56","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"潁川郡公。生蹈，字之義，南齊中軍。二子：嶼、嶸。嶼字秀望，梁永嘉縣丞。生寵，","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_57","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"字元輔，為臨海令。避侯景之難，徙居南康贛縣，生寶慎。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_58","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"鍾氏宰相一人。紹京。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_59","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"鍾氏表","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_60","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"宋氏出自子姓。殷王帝乙長子啟，周武王封之於宋，三十六世至君偃，為楚所滅，子孫","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_61","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"以國為氏。楚有上將軍義，義生昌，漢中尉，始居西河介休。十二世孫晃，晃三子：恭","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_62","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"、畿、洽，徙廣平利人。","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"宋氏宰相二人。璟、申錫。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_64","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"宋氏表","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_65","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"源氏出自後魏聖武帝詰汾長子疋孤。七世孫禿髮傉檀，據南涼，子賀降後魏，太武見之","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"曰：「與卿同源，可改為源氏。」位太尉、隴西宣王。生侍中馮翊惠公懷，懷二子：子","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_67","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"邕、子恭。子恭字靈順，中書監、臨汝文獻公，周、隋之際，居鄴郡安陽。生彪，字文","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_68","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"宗，隋莒州刺史、臨潁縣公，生師民。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_69","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"源氏宰相一人。乾曜。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_70","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"源氏表","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_71","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"牛氏出自子姓。宋微子之後司寇牛父，子孫以王父字為氏。漢有牛邯，為護羌校尉，因","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_72","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"居隴西，後徙安定，再徙鶉觚。","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_73","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"牛氏宰相二人。仙客、僧孺。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_74","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"牛氏表","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"苗氏出自芊姓。楚若敖生鬬伯比，伯比生子良。子良生越椒，字伯棼，以罪誅。其子賁","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_76","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"皇奔晉，晉侯與之苗邑，因以為氏，其地河內軹縣南有苗亭，即其地也。上黨長子縣有","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_77","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"苗襲夔。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74