39","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"，字子良，前秦右僕射、安丘敬公。生宣吉、宣褒。宣褒，後秦黃門侍郎，六世孫榮。","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_140","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"權氏宰相一人。德輿。","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_141","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"權氏表","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_142","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"皇甫氏出自子姓。宋戴公白生公子充石，字皇父。皇父生季子來，來生南雍○，以王父","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_143","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"字為氏。○六世孫孟之，孟之生遇，避地奔魯。裔孫鸞，漢興，自魯徙茂陵，改「父」","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_144","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"為「甫」。裔孫晉廣魏太守固，生柴，徙襄陽，後又徙壽春，裔孫珍義。","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_145","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"皇甫氏宰相一人。鎛。","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_146","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"皇甫氏表","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_147","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"程氏出自風姓。顓頊生稱，稱生老童。老童二子：重、黎。重為火正，司地，其後世為","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_148","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"掌天地之官。裔孫封於程，是謂程伯，雒陽有上程聚，即其地也。至周宣王時，程伯休","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_149","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"父失其官守，以諸侯入為王司馬，又有司馬氏。程氏世居長安。","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_150","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"思奉，利州刺史。","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_151","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"子珪，左贊善大夫。","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_152","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"獻可，太子左諭德。","sentenceOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_153","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"异字師舉，相憲宗。","sentenceOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_154","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTradition