,"chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"四世孫後魏晉興太守紛。五世孫偃師，徙河南。","sentenceOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_170","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"段氏宰相一人。文昌。","sentenceOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_171","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"段氏表","sentenceOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_172","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"元氏出自拓拔氏。黃帝生昌意，昌意少子悃，居北，十一世為鮮卑君長。平文皇帝鬱律","sentenceOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_173","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"二子：什翼犍、烏孤。什翼犍，昭成皇帝也，始號代王，至道武皇帝改號魏，至孝文帝","sentenceOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_174","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"更為元氏。","sentenceOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_175","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"什翼犍七子：一曰寔君，二曰翰，三曰閼婆，四曰壽鳩，五曰紇根，六曰力真，七曰窟","sentenceOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_176","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"咄。寔君生道武皇帝珪，珪生明元皇帝嗣，嗣生太武皇帝燾，燾生景穆皇帝晃。景穆諸","sentenceOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_177","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"子唯濬、新成、子推、天錫、雲、禎、胡兒、休八房子孫聞於唐。濬，文成皇帝也。文","sentenceOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_178","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"成諸子唯弘、長樂二房子孫聞於唐。弘，獻文皇帝也。獻文諸子唯宏、幹、羽、勰四房","sentenceOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_179","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"子孫聞於唐。宏，孝文帝也。七子：恂、恪、懷、愉、懌、悅。恪，宣武皇帝也。懷，","sentenceOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_180","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"廣平文穆王，生廣平文懿王悌，悌生侍中、驃騎大將軍、廣平王贊，贊生謙。","sentenceOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_181","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"元氏宰相一人。稹。大曆宰相元載，本景氏，故不著。","sentenceOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_182","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"元氏表","sentenceOrder":182},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_183","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"路氏出自姬姓。帝摯子玄元，堯封於中路，歷虞、夏稱侯，子孫以國為氏。漢符離侯博","sentenceOrde