":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"封其子仲於太原，故子孫世為太原人。二十三世孫後魏太原太守邕，邕五世孫建。","sentenceOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_200","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"白氏宰相一人。敏中。","sentenceOrder":200},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_201","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"白氏表","sentenceOrder":201},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_202","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"夏侯氏出自姒姓。夏禹裔孫東樓公封為杞侯，至簡公為楚所滅，弟他奔魯，魯悼公以其","sentenceOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_203","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"夏禹之後，給以采地為侯，因以為氏焉。後去魯之沛，分沛為譙，遂為郡人。唐有駕部","sentenceOrder":203},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_204","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"郎中審封。","sentenceOrder":204},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_205","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"審封。","sentenceOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_206","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"敏。","sentenceOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_207","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"敬。","sentenceOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_208","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"孜字好學，相宣宗、懿宗。","sentenceOrder":208},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_209","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"潭字虛中，禮部侍郎。","sentenceOrder":209},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_210","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"坦。","sentenceOrder":210},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_211","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"映字光文。","sentenceOrder":211},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_212","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"澤字表中。","sentenceOrder":212},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_213","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"斐。","sentenceOrder":213},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_214","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"敖。","sentenceOrder":214},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_215","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"藻字司文。","sentenceOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_216","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"夏侯氏宰相一人。孜。","sentenceOrder":216},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_217","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"蔣氏出自姬姓。周公第三子伯齡封於蔣，其地光州仙居縣是也，宋改為樂安，蔣為強國","sentenceOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_218","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"所滅，子孫因以為氏。漢有蔣詡，十世孫休，自樂安徙義興陽羨縣。十一世孫元遜，陳","sentenceOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_219","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"左衛將軍。其族有太子洗馬、弘文館學士瓌，生將明。","sentenceOrder":219},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_220","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"將明，國子司業、集賢殿學士、副知院使。","sentenceOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_221","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"乂字德源，祕書監、義興懿公。","sentenceOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_222","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"係，檢校左僕射、淮陽公。","sentenceOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_223","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"兆。","sentenceOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_224","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"承初字昌遠。","sentenceOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_225","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"曙字耀之。","sentenceOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_226","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"延翰。","sentenceOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_227","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"庸字臺臣。","sentenceOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_228","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"伸字大直，相宣宗、懿宗。","sentenceOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_229","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"泳字越之。","sentenceOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_230","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"偕，左補闕。","sentenceOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_231","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"仙。","sentenceOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_232","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"佶。","sentenceOrder":232},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_233","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"琛字獻之。","sentenceOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_234","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"蔣氏宰相一人。伸。","sentenceOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_235","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"畢氏出自姬姓。周文王第十五子高，封於畢，以國為氏。後漢兗州別駕諶，世居東平。","sentenceOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_236","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"五世孫衆慶，宋本州大中正。五世孫憬。","sentenceOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_237","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"憬，司衛少卿、許州刺史。","sentenceOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_238","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"構，戶部尚書、魏景公。","sentenceOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_239","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"抗，兵部員外郎、吳郡太守、江南採訪使。","sentenceOrder":239},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_240","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"○，王屋尉。","sentenceOrder":240},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_241","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"鎬。","sentenceOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_242","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"○。","sentenceOrder":242},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_243","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"銶。","sentenceOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_244","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"銳。","sentenceOrder":244},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_245","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"增。","sentenceOrder":245},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_246","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"栩，豐王府司馬。","sentenceOrder":246},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_247","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"浚，汾州長史。","sentenceOrder":247},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_248","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"勻，協律郎。","sentenceOrder":248},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_249","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"諴字存之，相懿宗。","sentenceOrder":249},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_250","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"紹顏，渭南尉、直史館。","sentenceOrder":250},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_251","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"知顏，千牛備身。","sentenceOrder":251},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_252","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"曜，侍御史。","sentenceOrder":252},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_253","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"畢氏宰相一人。諴。","sentenceOrder":253},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_254","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"曹姓出自顓頊。五世孫陸終第五子安，為曹姓，至曹挾，封之於邾，為楚所滅，復為曹","sentenceOrder":254},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_255","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"姓。唐有河南曹氏。","sentenceOrder":255},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_256","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"周。","sentenceOrder":256},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_257","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"景伯。","sentenceOrder":257},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_258","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"確字剛中，相懿宗。","sentenceOrder":258},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_259","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"希甫字嵩臣。","sentenceOrder":259},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_260","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"汾字道謙，戶部侍郎。","sentenceOrder":260},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_261","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"希幹字荷臣。","sentenceOrder":261},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_262","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"曹氏宰相一人。確。","sentenceOrder":262},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_263","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"徐氏出自嬴姓。皐陶生伯益，伯益生若木，夏后氏封之於徐，其地下邳僮縣是也。至偃","sentenceOrder":263},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_264","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"王三十二世為周所滅，復封其子宗為徐子。宗十一世孫章禹，為吳所滅，子孫以國為氏","sentenceOrder":264},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_265","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"。章禹十三世孫詵，為秦莊襄王相。生仲，仲字景伯。生延，字方遠。延生由，字智卿","sentenceOrder":265},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_266","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"。由生該，字昌言。該生光，字子暉，漢下邳太守。光生大司農靜，字君安。靜生益州","sentenceOrder":266},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_267","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"刺史萬秋，字蘭卿。萬秋生左曹給事充，字彥通。充生諫議大夫安仁。二子：豐、霸。","sentenceOrder":267},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_268","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"豐為北祖，霸為南祖。","sentenceOrder":268},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_269","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"徐氏宰相三人。商、彥若、世勣。","sentenceOrder":269},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_270","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"徐氏表","sentenceOrder":270},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_271","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"孔氏出自子姓。商帝乙長子微子啟封於宋，弟微仲衍曾孫湣公捷生弗父何，何生宋父周","sentenceOrder":271},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_272","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"，周生世父勝，勝生正考父，父生嘉，字孔父。孔父生木金父，金父生睪夷父，以王父","sentenceOrder":272},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_273","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"字為氏。生防叔，避華父督之難，奔魯，為大夫。生伯夏，夏生鄒大夫叔梁紇。紇二子","sentenceOrder":273},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_274","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"：孟皮、仲尼。仲尼為魯司寇，攝相事。生鯉，字伯魚。伯魚生伋，字子思，為魯穆公","sentenceOrder":274},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_275","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"師。生白，字子上，齊威王相。白生求，字子家。求生箕，字子京，魏相。箕生穿，字","sentenceOrder":275},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_276","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"子高。穿生斌，字子慎，一名胤，魏文侯相文信君。三子：鮒、騰、樹。騰字子襄，漢","sentenceOrder":276},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_277","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"孝惠博士、長沙太傅。生忠，字子貞，博士。忠二子：武、安國。武生延年，大將軍、","sentenceOrder":277},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_278","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"太傅。延年生霸，字次孺，給事中、高密相、褒成烈君。四子：福、振、喜、光。福，","sentenceOrder":278},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_279","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"關內侯。生房，房生均，字長平，尚書郎。生大司馬元成侯志，志生損。自均皆世襲褒","sentenceOrder":279},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_280","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"成侯，及損，徙封褒亭侯。生曜，曜生完，無子，以弟子魏奉議郎羨為嗣。羨生晉太常","sentenceOrder":280},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_281","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"卿、黃門侍郎震，震生嶷，嶷生豫章太守撫，撫生從事中郎懿。自羨以下襲奉聖侯。生","sentenceOrder":281},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_282","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"宋崇聖侯鮮，鮮生後魏崇聖大夫乘，乘生祕書郎靈珍，靈珍生文泰。自靈珍以下襲崇聖","sentenceOrder":282},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_283","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"侯。文泰生渠。","sentenceOrder":283},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_284","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"孔氏宰相一人。緯。","sentenceOrder":284},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_285","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"孔氏表","sentenceOrder":285},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_286","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"獨孤氏出自劉氏。後漢世祖生沛獻王輔，輔生釐王定，定生節王丐。丐二子：廣、廙。","sentenceOrder":286},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_287","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"廙，洛陽令。生穆，穆生度遼將軍進伯，擊匈奴，兵敗被執，囚之孤山下。生尸利，單","sentenceOrder":287},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_288","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"于以為谷蠡王，號獨孤部。尸利生烏利。二子：去卑、猛。猛生副論。副論生路孤，路","sentenceOrder":288},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_289","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"孤生眷，眷生羅辰，從後魏孝文徙洛陽，為河南人，初以其部為氏，位定州刺史、永安","sentenceOrder":289},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_290","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"公。生廷尉貞公萬齡。萬齡生稽，字延平，鎮東將軍、文公。稽生鎮東將軍歸，歸生冀","sentenceOrder":290},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_291","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"獨孤氏宰相一人。損。","sentenceOrder":291},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_292","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"獨孤氏表","sentenceOrder":292},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_293","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"李氏三公七人，三師二人。柳城李氏有光弼；武威李氏有抱玉；高麗李氏有正已。又柳","sentenceOrder":293},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_294","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"城李氏有寶臣；雞田李氏有光顏；范陽李氏有載義；代北李氏有克用。","sentenceOrder":294},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_295","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"李氏表","sentenceOrder":295},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_296","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"王氏三公二人，三師一人。營州王氏有思禮；河內王氏有智興；安東王氏有鎔。","sentenceOrder":296},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_297","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"王氏表","sentenceOrder":297},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_298","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"田氏出自媯姓。陳厲公子完，字敬仲，仕齊，初有采地，因號田氏。又云，「陳」「田","sentenceOrder":298},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_299","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"」聲相近也。至田和篡齊為諸侯，九世至王建，為秦所滅。漢興，諸田徙陽陵，後徙北","sentenceOrder":299},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_300","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"平。魏議郎田疇，字子泰。二十二世孫璟。","sentenceOrder":300},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_301","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"田氏三公一人。承嗣。","sentenceOrder":301},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_302","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"田氏表","sentenceOrder":302},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_303","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"烏氏出自姬姓。黃帝之後，少昊氏以烏鳥名官，以世功命氏。齊有烏之餘，裔孫世居北","sentenceOrder":303},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_304","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"方，號烏洛侯，後徙張掖。","sentenceOrder":304},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_305","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"烏氏三公一人。重胤。","sentenceOrder":305},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_306","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"烏氏表","sentenceOrder":306},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_307","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"唐宰相三百六十九人，凡九十八族。再入五十七人：長孫无忌、楊師道、李勣、褚遂良","sentenceOrder":307},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_308","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"、李義府、劉仁軌、騫味道、狄仁傑、姚璹、李元素、婁師德、陸元方、蘇味道、楊再","sentenceOrder":308},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_309","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"思、杜景佺、宗楚客、魏元忠、張錫、唐休璟、韋嗣立、蘇瓌、蕭至忠、岑羲、宋璟、","sent