raditional":"、朱全忠。以恩澤進者四人：武攸暨、李輔國、于頔、韓弘。皆通見宰相世系。別著田","sentenceOrder":323},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_324","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"氏、烏氏二族。希逸，亡其世系。輔國，中官也；懷恩，叛臣也；朱泚、王建、韓建、","sentenceOrder":324},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_74_325","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_74","textTraditional":"朱全忠，唐之盜也，皆削而不著。","sentenceOrder":325}],"overrides":{}}